						 <p>Who would understand it, then? :P</p> <p>It actually doesn't necessarily <em>need</em> to be understandable&#8230; but there should be a sentence or two explaining why it's <em>relevant</em>, at all.</p> <p>If it's only relevant to mages and has no real relevance to GOC operatives, or if it's something brief like &quot;It's an expression of the form of control that the user has over the spell&quot;, then any of that is okay too. Just needs to be mentioned.</p> 
				 	]]>
